> <linux-I+IVW8TIWO2tmTQ+vhA3Yw@public.gmane.org> wrote:
> > Maybe what we should do is:
> >
> > mkdir include/dt
> > git mv include/dt-bindings include/dt
> > for arch in arch/*; do
> >   dts=$arch/boot/dts
